     A**********************************************************
     A* IVPRPCRUL
     A* Re-run Repricing Rules - the pricing logic as data
     A**********************************************************
     A* One row per catalogue group / model / scenario / price band
     A* / last-price-change window. IVRRPCGEN loads the table into
     A* memory and takes the first row (by RULSEQ) whose price band
     A* and last-change window both match the item, so the pricing
     A* logic is maintained as data and never as code.
     A*
     A* Both published models fit this one shape:
     A*
     A*   Manual Price Change Brackets (RULMODEL B) uses RULUPLAMT
     A*   only - a flat dollar uplift per band per window.
     A*
     A*   Evaluating Bulk Reissue (RULMODEL P) uses RULUPLPCT with
     A*   RULMINAMT (its "min $1.50"), RULCAPPCT (its increase cap),
     A*   RULCAPAMT (its "cap $10"), RULFLOOR (its budget floor) and
     A*   RULROUND 99 (its "snapped to nearest .99"). Its two rates
     A*   per cell are two rows split on 01/01/2022: the stale rate
     A*   for items last repriced before then, the other after.
     A*
     A* Order of operations in IVRRPCGEN:
     A*   1. raw   = price + RULUPLAMT, or price * (1 + RULUPLPCT)
     A*   2. floor the rise at RULMINAMT
     A*   3. cap the rise at RULCAPPCT and at RULCAPAMT
     A*   4. round per RULROUND (99 = nearest .99, LADR = ladder)
     A*   5. re-assert RULFLOOR - the budget floor overrides the cap
     A*
     A* RULEXCLMN excludes cheap items from the band entirely (the
     A* Instrumental "titles under $5 excluded" accessories rule).
     A* RULDISP carries the disposition for dead titles through to
     A* the suggestion for reporting.
     A**********************************************************
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R IV$RPCRUL                 TEXT('Repricing rule')
     A            RULCATG        5A         TEXT('Catalogue group')
     A                                      COLHDG('CAT' 'GROUP')
     A            RULMODEL       1A         TEXT('Model B=bracket P=percent')
     A                                      COLHDG('MO' 'DEL')
     A            RULSCEN        1A         TEXT('Scenario S or A')
     A                                      COLHDG('SCEN' 'ARIO')
     A            RULSEQ         3S 0       TEXT('Match order within model')
     A                                      COLHDG('SEQ')
     A            RULPRCFR       9S 2       TEXT('Price band from incl')
     A                                      COLHDG('BAND' 'FROM')
     A            RULPRCTO       9S 2       TEXT('Price band to incl')
     A                                      COLHDG('BAND' 'TO')
     A            RULCHGFR        L         TEXT('Last chg window from')
     A                                      COLHDG('CHANGED' 'FROM')
     A            RULCHGTO        L         TEXT('Last chg window to')
     A                                      COLHDG('CHANGED' 'TO')
     A            RULUPLAMT      9S 2       TEXT('Flat dollar uplift')
     A                                      COLHDG('UPLIFT' 'AMOUNT')
     A            RULUPLPCT      5S 2       TEXT('Percentage uplift')
     A                                      COLHDG('UPLIFT' 'PCT')
     A            RULMINAMT      9S 2       TEXT('Minimum dollar rise')
     A                                      COLHDG('MIN' 'RISE')
     A            RULCAPPCT      5S 2       TEXT('Cap on the rise pct')
     A                                      COLHDG('CAP' 'PCT')
     A            RULCAPAMT      9S 2       TEXT('Cap on the rise amount')
     A                                      COLHDG('CAP' 'AMOUNT')
     A            RULFLOOR       9S 2       TEXT('Budget floor price')
     A                                      COLHDG('BUDGET' 'FLOOR')
     A            RULEXCLMN      9S 2       TEXT('Exclude items under this')
     A                                      COLHDG('EXCL' 'UNDER')
     A            RULROUND       4A         TEXT('Round NONE/99/LADR')
     A                                      COLHDG('ROUND' 'RULE')
     A            RULDISP       10A         TEXT('Dead-title disposition')
     A                                      COLHDG('DISPO' 'SITION')
     A            RULTEXT       30A         TEXT('Rule label for reporting')
     A                                      COLHDG('RULE' 'TEXT')
     A            RULMNTTS        Z         TEXT('Last maintained timestamp')
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'TS')
     A            RULMNTWHO     10A         TEXT('Last maintained by')
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'WHO')
     A          K RULCATG
     A          K RULMODEL
     A          K RULSCEN
     A          K RULSEQ
